      --description           what the agent should do                                      [字符串]
      --mode                  agent mode            [字符串] [可选值： "all", "primary", "subagent"]
      --permissions, --tools  comma-separated list of permissions to allow (default: all).
                              Available: "bash, read, edit, glob, grep, webfetch, task, todowrite,
                              websearch, lsp, skill"                                        [字符串]
  -m, --model                 model to use in the format of provider/model                  [字符串]"
`;

